sdk-build/openapi/published.yaml is a pinned copy of Mistral AI's official
OpenAPI specification from mistralai/platform-docs-public. See
sdk-build/provenance.lock.json for the immutable source revision and SHA-256,
and sdk-build/openapi/LICENSE for Apache-2.0 terms. Any upstream NOTICE is
retained at sdk-build/openapi/NOTICE when present.

src/ is a mechanical Rust SDK generated from that specification by pinned Fern
CLI 5.112.0 and fernapi/fern-rust-sdk 0.48.0, after deterministic reviewed
Mistral surface extensions. One narrow generated-output workaround for
multipart+SSE is tracked by fern-api/fern#17928 and documented under
sdk-build/fern/.

